    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following technical article and repurpose it into social media assets.\n\nARTICLE CONTENT:\n{{ $json.data }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert technical content strategist and ghostwriter. You turn dense technical blog posts and whitepapers into high-performing social media assets for an engineering-leadership audience.\n\nGenerate exactly:\n1. insights: 3 to 5 core technical insights, each a concise, specific, non-generic sentence grounded in the article.\n2. linkedin_carousel: an 8-slide executive LinkedIn carousel script. Slide 1 is a scroll-stopping hook, slides 2-7 break down the key ideas (one idea per slide, punchy and skimmable), slide 8 is a clear call to action. Each slide has slide (number), title (short), and body (1-3 short lines).\n3. twitter_thread: a 5-tweet technical X/Twitter thread. Tweet 1 hooks, tweets 2-4 deliver technical substance, tweet 5 wraps with a takeaway or CTA. Keep each tweet under 280 characters.\n\nBe accurate to the source material and never invent facts not supported by the article. Return only the structured object."
        }
      },
      "id": "6c0185e1-97ee-42ba-b9c7-45c0e6f8f54d",
